"settings.developerMessage" = "A note from the kitchen";
"settings.developerMessageBody" = "Hello, and welcome to my kitchen.

This is where I keep the meals I have cooked, and the warmth of ordinary days. I believe food carries more than flavour — it carries care.

The times and servings in these recipes are only a reference. Adjust them as you like, and find your own taste along the way.

May these dishes bring a little warmth to your table.

— Brook";
"about.privacy" = "Privacy";
"about.privacy.local" = "Jiachang has no accounts or network backend, and no analytics or ads. Your recipes and photos are stored in the app's private space (its sandbox) on this iPhone.";
"about.privacy.backup" = "This data may be included in system backups, depending on your settings. Deleting the app removes its local data; any backup copies are managed by the system.";
"about.privacy.transfer" = "There is no cloud sync, and nothing is moved to Mealie or other services automatically. Only when you choose “Share this dish” or “Make a cookbook” does Jiachang create an image or PDF on this iPhone and hand it to the system share sheet for you to send; Jiachang itself uploads nothing.";
"about.permissions" = "Permissions";
"about.permissions.camera" = "Camera: asked for only when you choose to take a photo for a recipe.";
"about.permissions.photos" = "Photos: picking a photo uses the system photo picker, so Jiachang only sees the photo you choose. Photos you take or pick are kept inside the app and are not saved to your photo library.";
"about.foodSafety" = "Cooking safely";
"about.foodSafety.body" = "Times and servings are a starting point; stoves, pans and appetites differ. Please check doneness yourself and watch for ingredients you or your guests are allergic to. Jiachang is not medical or nutritional advice.";
"about.licenses" = "Content and licence";
"about.licenses.starter" = "The photos of the starter recipes are AI-generated.";
"about.licenses.software" = "Jiachang's source code is released under the MIT License. The full terms are in the project's LICENSE file; this software licence does not grant rights to all photos.";
"about.licenses.userPhotos" = "Your own photos remain yours. Photos you add are separate from the starter images and do not become MIT-licensed by being added. Please only use photos you have the right to use.";
"about.licenses.font" = "Type is set in open-source fonts: headings and notes in Jiachang Kai, based on LXGW WenKai (SIL Open Font License 1.1), and body text in Jiachang Hei, based on LXGW Neo XiHei (IPA Font License 1.0). Both licence texts ship with the app.";
